    <string name="monet_expressive_desc">大胆而富有表现力的色彩组合，传达情感和创造力。</string>
    <string name="monet_fidelity">幻想</string>
    <string name="monet_fidelity_desc">忠实地表现颜色，确保视觉表现的准确性和真实性。</string>
    <string name="monet_fruitsalad">水果沙拉</string>
